<div title=\"-0.27592106\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><div title=\"A_19|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div><div title=\"-0.36518161\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><div title=\"A_20|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div><div title=\"-0.43072730\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><div title=\"A_21|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div><div title=\"-0.20115202\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><div title=\"A_22|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div><div title=\"-0.12749235\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><div title=\"A_23|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div><div title=\"-0.28852243\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><div title=\"A_24|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div><div title=\"0.35226747\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><div title=\"A_25|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div><div title=\"-0.03027791\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><div title=\"A_26|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div><div title=\"0.17649716\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><div title=\"A_27|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div><div title=\"0.37815694\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"174\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\">\r\n\r\n <span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span width=\"87\" style=\"width:65pt\">Pi</span>:</span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"174\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\"><span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"> </span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><br>A_1</span>\r\n  <span align=\"right\"><br>0.811594</span>\r\n </span>\r\n \r\n <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\">\r\n  <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><br>A_2</span>\r\n  <span align=\"right\"><br>0.855073</span>\r\n </span>\r\n \r\n <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\">\r\n  <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><br>A_3</span>\r\n  <span align=\"right\"><br>0.830918</span>\r\n </span>\r\n \r\n <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\">\r\n  <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><br>A_4</span>\r\n  <span align=\"right\"><br>0.845411</span>\r\n </span>\r\n \r\n <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\">\r\n  <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><br>.....</span></span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><br>A_26</span>\r\n  <span align=\"right\"><br>0.429952</span>\r\n </span>\r\n <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\">\r\n  <span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><br>A_27</span>\r\n  <span align=\"right\"><br>0.352657</span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"174\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\"><span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span align=\"right\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"174\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\"><span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span width=\"87\" style=\"width:65pt\">Pi</span> (item difficulty) ranges from 0.88 to 0.35, wheres the thresholds range from -1.20 to 0.38.<br></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"174\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\"><span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span align=\"right\">Is there a certain transformation formula for the thresholds? Or am I mistaken, that the Thresholds should somehow correspond to Item difficulty?<br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"174\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\"><span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span align=\"right\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"174\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\"><span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span align=\"right\">Thank you in advance!</span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"174\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\"><span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span align=\"right\">Kind regrads, <br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"174\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\"><span><span height=\"21\" style=\"min-height:16pt\"><span align=\"right\">Helene<br></span></span></span></span></div>"
    ]
