     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">I calculated a simple congeneric model (free factor loadings) for data from the Raven Matrices (only 27 Items). Data is binary, where 0 is a false answer and 1 a correct answer.<br><br><div>As I understood thresholds, they should in some way correspond to Item difficulty (Pi), since they describe the likelyhood of giving a correct (1) or false (0) answer.</div><div><br></div><div>I specified the model as follows: <br></div><div><br></div><div>kongenerisch &lt;- &#39;<br><br>kon=~A_1<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\t</span>+<br>A_2<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\t</span>+<br>A_3<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\t</span>+<br>A_4<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\t</span>+<br>A_5<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\t</span>+<br>....<br>A_26 +<br>A_27<span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">\t</span><br><br>&#39;<br><br>fit_kongenerisch &lt;- cfa(kongenerisch, full_data_dur_27, ordered = T, estimator = &quot;DWLS&quot; ) <br></div><div><br></div><div>Output generated is the following (Model Fits are good, N = 207):<br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin-top:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Latent Variables:\r\n                   Estimate  Std.Err  z-value  P(&gt;|z|)   Std.lv  Std.all\r\n  kon =~                                                                \r\n    A_1               1.000                               0.702    0.702\r\n    A_2               1.175    0.079   14.944    0.000    0.825    0.825\r\n    A_3               1.232    0.077   16.005    0.000    0.865    0.865\r\n    A_4               1.111    0.074   15.028    0.000    0.780    0.780\r\n    A_5               0.963    0.069   13.888    0.000    0.676    0.676\r\n   .....\r\n    A_26              0.810    0.064   12.634    0.000    0.569    0.569\r\n    A_27              0.579    0.060    9.639    0.000    0.407    0.407\r\n\r\nThresholds:\r\n                   Estimate  Std.Err  z-value  P(&gt;|z|)   Std.lv  Std.all\r\n    A_1|t1           -0.884    0.101   -8.757    0.000   -0.884   -0.884\r\n    A_2|t1           -1.058    0.108   -9.833    0.000   -1.058   -1.058\r\n    A_3|t1           -0.958    0.104   -9.249    0.000   -0.958   -0.958\r\n    A_4|t1           -1.017    0.106   -9.604    0.000   -1.017   -1.017\r\n    A_5|t1           -0.849    0.100   -8.505    0.000   -0.849   -0.849\r\n   ....\r\n    A_26|t1           0.176    0.088    2.010    0.044    0.176    0.176\r\n    A_27|t1           0.378    0.090    4.219    0.000    0.378    0.378</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin-top:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Monaco,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin-top:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><br></span></span></div><div>Seperatelly caluclated Pi values (equal to SD of each item):</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.88378628\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_2|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-1.05843960\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_3|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.95779875\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_4|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-1.01694679\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_5|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.84854366\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_6|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-1.17113158\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_7|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.52579044\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_8|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.71690948\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_9|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.99684329\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_10|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.36518161\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_11|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-1.19551966\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_12|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.09094508\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_13|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.12749235\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_14|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"-0.73265625\" style=\"text-overflow:ellipsis\"></div>\r\n\r\n<div title=\"A_15|t1\" style=\"max-width:300px\"></div>\r\n\r\